Implemented subset: exact full-range token credits and explicit legacy migration; bounded throttle/cooldown mutex waits; monotone operation deadline state connected to process/throttle adapters; legal HTTP attempts, cumulative waits, exact refusal precedence and post-consumer completion admission.
Whole M-V7 remains open: journal authority, remaining process framing/counters/lifecycle authority and complete update survey proof/effect correspondence are not closed here.
